WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:04.880
Choose the Keypad tab.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.835
Type the number in international form, starting with a plus.

00:00:08.835 --> 00:00:12.851
Or pick the country flag first, and type the national number.

00:00:13.306 --> 00:00:17.710
The number is formatted as you type, and turned into a full international

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.549
number before it is dialed.

00:00:19.549 --> 00:00:22.615
The green Call button, or Enter, places the call.

00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:24.566
This video does not press it.

